{"id":"n84547-3-5","stage":4,"title":"새까맣다 · 一无所知","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n84547-3-5-1","ko":"엄마, 탄내가 나는데요?","zh":"妈妈，有股焦味。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}},{"text":"탄내가","meaning":"焦，糊；气味","explanation":"타다：焦，糊；내：气味；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"타다","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3"},{"term":"내","audio":"/audio/b3378685b76ee79fd0ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91122","senseId":"3","lemma":"타다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"41383","senseId":"1","lemma":"내","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"탄내가","audio":"/audio/5bbce51270c15af5900d.mp3"}},{"text":"나는데요?","meaning":"发出，泛出，响出，有","explanation":"나다：发出，泛出，响出，有；는데요：礼貌地交代背景、感想或含蓄的对照。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"16","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나는데요","audio":"/audio/841b90695b7601fb60e0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"8f835109fdc29a59","term":"타다","zh":"焦，糊","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3","entryId":"91122","definition":"由于过度烧、烤而变黑。","pronunciation":["타다"]},{"id":"b3378685b76ee79f","term":"내","zh":"气味","audio":"/audio/b3378685b76ee79fd0ef.mp3","entryId":"41383","definition":"鼻子可以闻到的气息。","pronunciation":["내"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发出，泛出，响出，有","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"产生能察觉到的声音或气味等。","pronunciation":["나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d73b136f1d7434586347.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n84547-3-5-2","ko":"어머, 불 위에 냄비 올려 놓은 걸 새까맣게 잊었네!","zh":"哎呀，完全忘了炉子上还放着锅！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어머,","meaning":"哎哟，哦","explanation":"어머：哎哟，哦","readings":[{"term":"어머","audio":"/audio/9a1c609712d2db0e30b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30195","senseId":"1","lemma":"어머","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어머","audio":"/audio/9a1c609712d2db0e30b8.mp3"}},{"text":"불","meaning":"火","explanation":"불：火","readings":[{"term":"불","audio":"/audio/05e6efdf147502fc3ac3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61154","senseId":"1","lemma":"불","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"불","audio":"/audio/05e6efdf147502fc3ac3.mp3"}},{"text":"위에","meaning":"上","explanation":"위：上；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"위","audio":"/audio/e0bebb354d8f7f3b0c82.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71462","senseId":"3","lemma":"위","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"위에","audio":"/audio/045b71d3898d7969a90d.mp3"}},{"text":"냄비","meaning":"小锅，汤锅，铝锅","explanation":"냄비：小锅，汤锅，铝锅","readings":[{"term":"냄비","audio":"/audio/61c1473461c3ddf8ec3f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41163","senseId":"1","lemma":"냄비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"냄비","audio":"/audio/61c1473461c3ddf8ec3f.mp3"}},{"text":"올려","meaning":"放，抬","explanation":"올리다：放，抬；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"올리다","audio":"/audio/ff5095d829513a79ee33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22109","senseId":"4","lemma":"올리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올려","audio":"/audio/7451fed596c0e318c0ce.mp3"}},{"text":"놓은","meaning":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","explanation":"놓다：表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"놓다","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72578","senseId":"1","lemma":"놓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놓은","audio":"/audio/269721ea83189783919a.mp3"}},{"text":"걸","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸","audio":"/audio/6cebaf71218a575e8966.mp3"}},{"text":"새까맣게","meaning":"一无所知，一干二净，全然","explanation":"새까맣다：一无所知，一干二净，全然；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"새까맣다","audio":"/audio/ae021538606001ef77b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84547","senseId":"3","lemma":"새까맣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"새까맣게","audio":"/audio/2944d70295d9042dc131.mp3"}},{"text":"잊었네!","meaning":"忘，忘记，忘却","explanation":"잊다：忘，忘记，忘却；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"잊다","audio":"/audio/b0566314f635fe32e273.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70067","senseId":"1","lemma":"잊다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잊었네","audio":"/audio/e0d06e02bc575bda86d7.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9a1c609712d2db0e","term":"어머","zh":"哎哟，哦","audio":"/audio/9a1c609712d2db0e30b8.mp3","entryId":"30195","definition":"主要是女性因没料到的事情感到惊讶或感叹时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["어머"]},{"id":"05e6efdf147502fc","term":"불","zh":"火","audio":"/audio/05e6efdf147502fc3ac3.mp3","entryId":"61154","definition":"物质散发着光和热而燃烧。","pronunciation":["불"]},{"id":"e0bebb354d8f7f3b","term":"위","zh":"上","audio":"/audio/e0bebb354d8f7f3b0c82.mp3","entryId":"71462","definition":"某东西的表面或平坦的表面。","pronunciation":["위"]},{"id":"61c1473461c3ddf8","term":"냄비","zh":"小锅，汤锅，铝锅","audio":"/audio/61c1473461c3ddf8ec3f.mp3","entryId":"41163","definition":"煮食物时使用的器具，比铁锅小，带有盖子和手把。","pronunciation":["냄비"]},{"id":"ff5095d829513a79","term":"올리다","zh":"放，抬","audio":"/audio/ff5095d829513a79ee33.mp3","entryId":"22109","definition":"使搁在某处上。","pronunciation":["올리다"]},{"id":"bac7d20277d64d67","term":"놓다","zh":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3","entryId":"72578","definition":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","pronunciation":["노타"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"ae021538606001ef","term":"새까맣다","zh":"一无所知，一干二净，全然","audio":"/audio/ae021538606001ef77b3.mp3","entryId":"84547","definition":"完全没有记忆或完全不知道。","pronunciation":["새까마타"]},{"id":"b0566314f635fe32","term":"잊다","zh":"忘，忘记，忘却","audio":"/audio/b0566314f635fe32e273.mp3","entryId":"70067","definition":"本来知道的事情记不住或记不起来。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/d25f6255543e60e40df0.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.977,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=84547","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"고급","day":142,"sequenceScore":2.8037,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["哎呀，完全忘了炉子上还放着锅！","要来点樱桃番茄吗？","妈妈，有股焦味。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["哎呀，完全忘了炉子上还放着锅！","妈妈，有股焦味。","要来点樱桃番茄吗？"],"answer":0}]}
